  "slug": "tropical-cosmopolitan-recipe-11986723",
  "name": "This Tropical Cosmopolitan Tastes Like a Beach Vacation",
  "recipe_type": "drink",
  "brief_description": "This tropical twist on the classic Cosmopolitan combines coconut, mango, and pineapple for bright island-inspired flavor. Served ice cold, it\u2019s a refreshing cocktail that feels like a mini tropical getaway.",
  "cuisine": "American",
  "instructions": [
    {
      "position": 1,
      "text": "Combine coconut vodka, mango cranberry juice, pineapple juice, lime juice, and cream of coconut in a cocktail shaker. Add ice and shake until very cold. Strain the drink into 2 martini glasses. Garnish with a slice of lime. Enjoy!"
    }
  ],
  "servings": 2,
